    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this game unfolds in the same universe as our previous title &quot;Black Box - The Shining Immortal&quot;, new players can still dive straight in without missing a beat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/79d610abab11c769d0dd584f5b723b16.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764 \u3010Game Overview\u3011 \u2764</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/9b18c726f92b0e3a1aa30dcda5b66b46.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a thriller and suspense visual novel themed around &quot;<strong>mad love</strong>.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a member of a special minority group. The game offers a story of his journey as he forges connections with his online friend, and gradually falls in love. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of a futuristic sci-fi world, this medium-length game unfolds within a vast world full of intrigue. Beautifully illustrated in pixel art, with a riveting soundtrack that sets the mood. The game's rich dialogue and introspective monologues are presented in a simple and easily understood manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764 \u3010Characters\u3011 \u2764</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/f22bd3c272bf1e8f17dcf282875e71ef.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/853be37b28d143e4db4361f6021d8a84.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764 \u3010Estimated Playtime\u3011 \u2764</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The length of gameplay varies based on each player's reading pace, typically ranges from 3 to 5 hours. A game streaming may take about 6 hours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this game unfolds in the same universe as our previous title &quot;Black Box - The Shining Immortal&quot;, new players can still dive straight in without missing a beat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/79d610abab11c769d0dd584f5b723b16.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764 \u3010Game Overview\u3011 \u2764</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/9b18c726f92b0e3a1aa30dcda5b66b46.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a thriller and suspense visual novel themed around &quot;<strong>mad love</strong>.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a member of a special minority group. The game offers a story of his journey as he forges connections with his online friend, and gradually falls in love. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of a futuristic sci-fi world, this medium-length game unfolds within a vast world full of intrigue. Beautifully illustrated in pixel art, with a riveting soundtrack that sets the mood. The game's rich dialogue and introspective monologues are presented in a simple and easily understood manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764 \u3010Characters\u3011 \u2764</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/f22bd3c272bf1e8f17dcf282875e71ef.avif?t=1733374936\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435810/extras/853be37b28d143e4db4361f6021d8a84.avif?t=1